From c6007ab003ced3e5df2b53f256d17d6f0b58971a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nillikechatchat <yuanhenglizhen2050@163.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 10:59:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: comprehensive improvements for MapleOS v0.1.0

P0 - Critical Fixes:
- fix(sync): add mutex lock for concurrent sync, fix push failure state inconsistency
- fix(engine): implement true parallel execution with tokio::spawn
- feat(engine): enhance condition evaluator with >, <, >=, <=, &&, || operators

P1 - Important Features:
- fix(gateway): reuse WebSocket connections for MCP tool calls
- feat(server): add JWT authentication middleware
- feat(server): add REST API endpoints (workflow CRUD, auth, memory)
- fix(agent): implement resolve_approval with watch channels
- fix(gateway): consume stderr pipe to prevent blocking

P2 - Improvements:
- refactor(server): externalize all config via ServerConfig and env vars
- feat(server): implement actual skills (http_request, file_ops, code_execute, web_search)
- fix(engine): improve subworkflow node matching with :: separator
- fix(engine): add webhook request timeout (30s)
Co-authored-by: monkeycode-ai <monkeycode-ai@chaitin.com>
